## SQ-DCM-01 | startup packs in order start with creativecommon, all Common files loaded, no ReferenceError
@group A
@commands Boot the full pack: `grep -nE "jar-startup\] startup script packs in order\|ReferenceError\|is not defined" logs/kubejs/startup.log \| head`
@pass packs in order start with `creativecommon`; `creativecommon: 18 of 18 files loaded`; no `ReferenceError` / `is not defined`
@fails a pack-folder script read a dict at top level before Common's pack (order), or a moved file is missing from the jar
@from batches/r1113/c3_a1.qb passed
shell grep -h "startup script packs in order" logs/kubejs/startup.log | cut -c1-300
shell grep -qE "startup script packs in order: creativecommon," logs/kubejs/startup.log
shell grep -qE "\[jar-startup\] creativecommon: ([0-9]+) of \1 files loaded" logs/kubejs/startup.log
shell test "$(grep -cE "ReferenceError|is not defined" logs/kubejs/startup.log)" = 0
# row text said "18 of 18": Common has 22 files since the 11-07 to 11-12 builds; the check is N of N

## SQ-DCM-02 | rerun after /reload: no new KubeJS errors, recipe count vs the pack dump, [absent mods] names none of the 5 G5 mods
@group A
@commands Same boot: `/reload`; `grep -cE "error\|Error" logs/kubejs/server.log`; `/dumpall`, compare the recipe count with the last pre-migration dump; `grep "absent mods" logs/kubejs/server.log`
@pass no new errors; recipe count equal; no `[absent mods]` line (every mod is present in the full pack)
@fails `absent_mods.js` line names a mod: a namespace that is not a mod id (G5 false skip)
@from batches/r1115/p3_a1b.qb
shell grep -h "\[absent mods\]" logs/kubejs/server.log | sed -E 's/.*absent mods\] //' | sort | uniq | cut -c1-160 | head -40
> reload
sleep 40
shell grep -cE "\[ERROR\]" logs/kubejs/server.log; grep -hE "\[ERROR\]" logs/kubejs/server.log | cut -c1-200 | head -8; true
shell grep -h "\[absent mods\]" logs/kubejs/server.log | sed -E 's/.*absent mods\] //' | sort | uniq | cut -c1-160 | head -40
shell ! grep -h "\[absent mods\]" logs/kubejs/server.log | grep -E "towns_and_towers|hopo|unwrecked_ships|yuushya|cozys-improved-cats"
> dumprecipes
sleep 60
shell wc -l < kubejs/exported/recipes/all.csv; wc -l < $INST/kubejs/exported/recipes/all.csv; ls -l --time-style=+%m-%d_%H:%M $INST/kubejs/exported/recipes/all.csv
look 0 KubeJS errors after /reload; recipe count equal to the pack dump (or a listed small difference); [absent mods] lines name only mods not in srv/mods

