## SQ-CDFO-02 | no Cooking for Blockheads, Balm or Incubation: no class load error, no recipe / tag / loot error naming them
@group B
@commands CD chain without Cooking for Blockheads, Balm and Incubation
@pass boots; no CfB / Incubation class load error, no recipe, tag or loot error naming `cookingforblockheads` or the nests in `latest.log`
@fails a compartment class referenced outside its `init`
@from batches/r1113/c3_ch1.qb
bootreject (NoClassDefFoundError|ClassNotFoundException).*(cookingforblockheads|blay09|incubation|balm)
bootreject (Couldn't parse|Unknown item|Unknown tag|Can't find|Failed to load).*(cookingforblockheads|incubation|_nest\b)
shell grep -ciE "cookingforblockheads|incubation" logs/latest.log
> zq item creativedelight:oak_spice_rack
> zq item creativedelight:duck_nest
waitlog \[zq\] item creativedelight:duck_nest 20
look both compartment items absent or inert (class AirItem, or registered but no error); the grep count is for the record (a WARN that says a compartment is off is fine)

## SQ-CDFO-03 | CfB present, Incubation absent: boots; rack half loads, nest half does not
@group B
@commands Pack with CfB but no Incubation; then Incubation without Alex's Mobs and Untitled Duck Mod
@pass each boots; only the present half's content loads. Also CfB installed with `[compartments] cookingforblockheads = false`: no racks, no oven mixins, no rack merges
@fails built-in pack mod list, mixin gate, `Compartments` switch
@from batches/r1113/c3_ch2.qb
bootexpect Done \(
bootreject (NoClassDefFoundError|ClassNotFoundException).*(incubation|cookingforblockheads|blay09)
bootreject (Couldn't parse|Unknown item|Unknown tag|Failed to load).*(incubation|cookingforblockheads)
> zq item creativedelight:oak_spice_rack
waitlog \[zq\] item creativedelight:oak_spice_rack 20
expect item creativedelight:oak_spice_rack: class (?!AirItem)
> zq item creativedelight:duck_nest
waitlog \[zq\] item creativedelight:duck_nest 20
> zq recipes creativedelight:shaped/oak_spice_rack
waitlog \[zq\] recipes matching creativedelight:shaped/oak_spice_rack: \d+ 30
shell grep -A6 "^\[compartments\]" config/creativedelight-common.toml | grep -E "incubation|cookingforblockheads"
look rack item registered (a CfB compartment class), nest item AirItem or inert; the oven / fridge mixins applied (grep `creativedelight` mixin lines naming cookingforblockheads in latest.log)

